module Laws
    intent =
        "The second proof entry: every law-carrying module outside the Script"
        "engine's cone, gathered under one root so aver proof can export them"
        "together and CI can ratchet them (n1bor/btc-listener#349)."
        "The CI proof job exports domain/interp.av, which reaches the engine"
        "and nothing else; Chainwork's three laws sat outside it from the day"
        "they were written, gated by nothing but aver verify, and every law"
        "over the chain, the stores and the codecs would have too. This module"
        "depends on those modules and defines nothing: nothing depends on it,"
        "so it cannot make a cycle, and it exposes nothing, so nothing is"
        "unused. Its one function is here because a module needs one to be a"
        "program, and it says which modules the entry gathers."
        "aver proof main.av would be the whole program, and at the d8bf3e01"
        "pin it gets close: it exports without panicking -- the panic this"
        "note used to name closed as jasisz/aver#1449 -- and classifies 152"
        "universal and 13 bounded laws, the union of both cones. What stops"
        "it being the one gated entry is 22 verify cases in Infra.Headers and"
        "Infra.Utxo that the Lean build isolates with errors, and one law of"
        "Infra.Utxo's that lands on sorry, which a sorry budget of zero"
        "forbids. Both are jasisz/aver#1462, whose other two shapes are"
        "already fixed. This leaf reaches no infra module, so neither reaches"
        "it, and n1bor/btc-listener#350 retires when #1462 closes."
    exposes [gathered]
    depends [Domain.Address, Domain.Block, Domain.Chainwork, Domain.Connect, Domain.Disconnect, Domain.Handshake, Domain.HeaderTree, Domain.Inventory, Domain.Segment, Domain.Snapshot, Domain.Subsidy, Domain.Target, Domain.TreeStore, Domain.UtxoStore, Domain.Watchdog]
    effects []

fn gathered() -> Int
    ? "How many law-carrying modules this entry gathers: the depends list above."
    15

verify gathered
    gathered() => 15
